{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/611aa98870b4e88a1e6033e7fc464e2c.poster.avif?t=1771917331\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/611aa98870b4e88a1e6033e7fc464e2c.webm?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/611aa98870b4e88a1e6033e7fc464e2c.mp4?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first-person horror maze game. Hiding &amp; Standing still is Death. Run or you are DEAD. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Trapped in a realm of nightmarish mazes with your only hope of survival is to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">all of the pages to the mysterious book and ESCAPE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This is the first chapter in The Paper Trials. survive the first maze. You are not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The doctors in there and they are looking for you. Will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/d1783b53e581e8a2be518dec6e2aea67.poster.avif?t=1771917331\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/d1783b53e581e8a2be518dec6e2aea67.webm?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/d1783b53e581e8a2be518dec6e2aea67.mp4?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/47761926cb53f442413cf643bdded149.poster.avif?t=1771917331\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/47761926cb53f442413cf643bdded149.webm?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2548330/extras/47761926cb53f442413cf643bdded149.mp4?t=1771917331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Arcade Horror: No hiding. Run for your life. Enemies can be avoided, but not killed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unique Art style: Everything is Hand drawn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Replay ability: You will want to replay the levels multiple times until you find the best route to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> escape fastest time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Paper Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2548330/ca4faf29ca522301fa756eb4eb4011544e1d958c.jpg"},{"name":"Paper Enthusiast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2548330/2d0597578374d29e0387395072a3159557b718cf.jpg"},{"name":"Paper Stalker ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2548330/24d98d97f81a65b4dfb89bfad9a6ce6d1f54c64f.jpg"},{"name":"No Medicine Today!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima